'''Thief Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that was introduced in [[Version 2.0 Update|Version 2.0]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 5.4 Update|Version 5.4]] grants [[Area Attack]] and increases range and attack power. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 8.2 Update|Version 8.2]]. In [[The Battle Cats POP!]], Thief Cat is unlocked into the Rare Capsule pool once clearing [[Saudi Arabia (Empire of Cats)|Saudi Arabia]].

